{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassEndomorphism.ChiV3ClosedFormProof","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassEndomorphism.ChiV3ClosedFormProof","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_decomposition_at_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_decomposition_at_two","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L184-L192","doc":"**Numerical cross-check at q = 2 (ε = 1)**: closed form returns\n`-75/8` (verified above). At ε = 1, the geometric tail\n`(1+1)⁻¹/4 = 1/8`, and the polynomial part\n`-(32 + 8 - 2)/4 = -38/4 = -19/2`. Sum: `-19/2 + 1/8 = -76/8 + 1/8\n= -75/8` ✓. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_geom_part_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_geom_part_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L178-L182","doc":"At `q = 1` (ε = 0): the geometric part is `1/4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_polynomial_part_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_polynomial_part_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L169-L175","doc":"At `q = 1` (ε = 0): the polynomial part is `−(1 + 1 − 1)/4 = −1/4`.\nTogether with the geometric part `1/4` (below) this gives the full\ndifference `0` at `q = 1`, consistent with `chi_V3_difference_at_one`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_decomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_decomposition","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L153-L160","doc":"**Decomposition**: the V_(3) closed form splits as\npolynomial part + geometric part. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_geom_part","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_geom_part","kind":"def","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L147-L150","doc":"The **inverse-power-series part** `q⁻¹/4` (geometric series\n`(1/4) · Σ (-1)^k ε^k` at `q = 1 + ε`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_polynomial_part","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_polynomial_part","kind":"def","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L141-L145","doc":"The **polynomial part** of the V_(3) closed form\n`−(q⁵ + q³ − q)/4` (degree 5 in `q`, contributes nothing at\n`ε^k` for `k ≥ 6`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L115-L120","doc":"At `q = 1`: the difference vanishes (proton/neutron are\nindistinguishable at the classical limit). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_at_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_at_two","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L107-L112","doc":"Numerical check at `q = 2`:\n`-(2^5 + 2^3 - 2 - 1/2)/4 = -(32 + 8 - 2 - 0.5)/4 = -37.5/4 = -75/8`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_eq_polynomial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_eq_polynomial","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L93-L98","doc":"**Closed form for `χ_(3)(β_n) − χ_(3)(β_p)`** (polynomial form). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_factored_eq_polynomial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_factored_eq_polynomial","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L85-L90","doc":"**Factored ↔ polynomial form** identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_eq_factored","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_eq_factored","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L76-L82","doc":"**Closed form for `χ_(3)(β_n) − χ_(3)(β_p)`** (factored). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_polynomial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_polynomial","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L70-L72","doc":"Equivalent polynomial form: `-(q^5 + q^3 - q - q⁻¹)/4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_factored","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_difference_factored","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L58-L68","doc":"The closed-form expression for the V_(3) n−p character difference.\n\nDUPLICATION TRACKING: this expression also appears as\n`chi_V3_diff_closed` in\n`rem:chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms`. The two are\nsemantically identical; chapter-block file isolation prevents\ndirect cross-file import. Centralisation deferred per AGENTS.md\n\"tracked-duplication acceptable when files are chapter-isolated\"\nconvention. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_beta_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_beta_n","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L48-L50","doc":"χ_(3)(β_n) on the neutron typed-B_3 braid (5σ + 4σ⁻¹ + 2 averaged). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_beta_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_beta_p","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v3-closed-form-proof.lean#L43-L46","doc":"χ_(3)(β_p) on the proton typed-B_3 braid (6σ + 3σ⁻¹ + 2 averaged).\nOn V_(3): σ → q, σ⁻¹ → q⁻¹, averaged → (q+q⁻¹)/2. ","signatureChunk":0}]}